<title>UK: Carlsberg-Tetley,Bass in distribution talks -paper.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg-Tetley,Bass in distribution talks -paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brewer Carlsberg-Tetley is in talks with rival Bass Plc aimed at forging a distribution tie-up, the Observer newspaper said.</p>
<p>The negotiations could lead to Carlsberg-Tetley's distribution operation being taken over by Tradeteam, a Bass joint venture with transport group NFC, and would threaten up to 1,300 jobs, the paper said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom + 44 171 542 7717</p>
